WEBVTT

1
00:00:18,990 --> 00:00:20,430
I'm your best brother

2
00:00:20,430 --> 00:00:21,750
I helped you chase your luck

3
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:22,950
I killed my love rival for you

4
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:24,630
I even helped your brother clean up his mess a few times.

5
00:00:24,630 --> 00:00:26,870
You will definitely save me, right Shen?

6
00:00:26,870 --> 00:00:28,270
You are heartless and unjust

7
00:00:28,270 --> 00:00:32,690
This person is more ruthless than me

8
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:34,610
Qingjia contacted Qi Xiang

9
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:36,730
Moon Rabbit came with eight base teams for reinforcements.

10
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:38,280
Where are you?

11
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:39,200
Arriving at the Galaxy Base

12
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:40,680
But it's already surrounded by loss and speculation.

13
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:42,400
The entrance to the city was poisoned by hundreds of thousands of losses

14
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:43,640
Qisang said he was thinking of other ways

15
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:44,560
It will be restored tonight at the latest

16
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:46,000
Which of you killed my brother?
